    Title_heading-level-2__fkwub 
    Title_heading-type-black__XaDYF" style="color:transparent;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, #FEE1D6, #FCA785);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;text-shadow:0px 0px 35px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);font-size:72px;font-weight:500">Let AI build AI</h2></div><div class="__className_37cf7d" style="text-align:center"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-white__Y__kN" style="font-size:20px;line-height:30px;font-weight:200">Meet Teammately, the autonomous AI Agent that self-iterates AI products, models and agents towards your objectives in a level that human-alone could not achieve.</span></div></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:250px"><div class="ant-row css-bi7g14" style="row-gap:36px;width:100%"><div style="order:0" class="ant-col ant-col-9 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:30px"><div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #F97E49, #FEF5D6);display:inline-block;padding:2px;border-radius:12px;height:30px;box-shadow:0px 0px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)"><div style="border-radius:10px;background:var(--background-color-paingain);overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:1px 10px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF">Generate</span></div></div><h3 class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-title-text__4Bk7v"><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-title-text-gray__RV1ls"> </span><span>The AI AI-Engineer generates a draft architecture for your AI based on best practices and the latest methods.</span></h3><div class="__className_37cf7d WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_points-container__w2ANh"><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-container___pKIC"><div><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-icon__JUZRP" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 16 3 C 8.800781 3 3 8.800781 3 16 C 3 23.199219 8.800781 29 16 29 C 23.199219 29 29 23.199219 29 16 C 29 14.601563 28.8125 13.207031 28.3125 11.90625 L 26.6875 13.5 C 26.886719 14.300781 27 15.101563 27 16 C 27 22.101563 22.101563 27 16 27 C 9.898438 27 5 22.101563 5 16 C 5 9.898438 9.898438 5 16 5 C 19 5 21.695313 6.195313 23.59375 8.09375 L 25 6.6875 C 22.699219 4.386719 19.5 3 16 3 Z M 27.28125 7.28125 L 16 18.5625 L 11.71875 14.28125 L 10.28125 15.71875 L 15.28125 20.71875 L 16 21.40625 L 16.71875 20.71875 L 28.71875 8.71875 Z"></path></svg></div><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-description-text__HgOZx">The AI Agent generates prompts based on the best practices of each model.</span></div><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-container___pKIC"><div><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-icon__JUZRP" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 16 3 C 8.800781 3 3 8.800781 3 16 C 3 23.199219 8.800781 29 16 29 C 23.199219 29 29 23.199219 29 16 C 29 14.601563 28.8125 13.207031 28.3125 11.90625 L 26.6875 13.5 C 26.886719 14.300781 27 15.101563 27 16 C 27 22.101563 22.101563 27 16 27 C 9.898438 27 5 22.101563 5 16 C 5 9.898438 9.898438 5 16 5 C 19 5 21.695313 6.195313 23.59375 8.09375 L 25 6.6875 C 22.699219 4.386719 19.5 3 16 3 Z M 27.28125 7.28125 L 16 18.5625 L 11.71875 14.28125 L 10.28125 15.71875 L 15.28125 20.71875 L 16 21.40625 L 16.71875 20.71875 L 28.71875 8.71875 Z"></path></svg></div><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-description-text__HgOZx">The AI Agent builds RAG by automatically handling all processes, including chunking, embedding, and indexing.</span></div><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-container___pKIC"><div><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-icon__JUZRP" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 16 3 C 8.800781 3 3 8.800781 3 16 C 3 23.199219 8.800781 29 16 29 C 23.199219 29 29 23.199219 29 16 C 29 14.601563 28.8125 13.207031 28.3125 11.90625 L 26.6875 13.5 C 26.886719 14.300781 27 15.101563 27 16 C 27 22.101563 22.101563 27 16 27 C 9.898438 27 5 22.101563 5 16 C 5 9.898438 9.898438 5 16 5 C 19 5 21.695313 6.195313 23.59375 8.09375 L 25 6.6875 C 22.699219 4.386719 19.5 3 16 3 Z M 27.28125 7.28125 L 16 18.5625 L 11.71875 14.28125 L 10.28125 15.71875 L 15.28125 20.71875 L 16 21.40625 L 16.71875 20.71875 L 28.71875 8.71875 Z"></path></svg></div><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-description-text__HgOZx">The AI Agent builds a multi-step generation architecture to enable advanced AI, including reasoning and agentic RAG.</span></div></div></div></div><div style="order:1" class="ant-col ant-col-2 css-bi7g14"></div><div style="order:2" class="ant-col ant-col-13 css-bi7g14"><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_youtube-video__OA2cN" style="overflow:hidden;padding-top:69.61805555555556%;position:relative;height:0;border-radius:16px"><iframe src="https://customer-3zz70ux3zdvq6qk7.cloudflarestream.com/8f13085bb958f4bf13c3e35913c83565/iframe?muted=true&amp;loop=true&amp;autoplay=true&amp;poster=https%3A%2F%2Fcustomer-3zz70ux3zdvq6qk7.cloudflarestream.com