    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF">Iterate, not just Generate</span></div></div><h3 class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-title-text__4Bk7v"><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-title-text-gray__RV1ls"> </span><span>The AI AI-Engineer productionizes your AI through large-scale evaluation and iteration.</span></h3><div class="__className_37cf7d WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_points-container__w2ANh"><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-container___pKIC"><div><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-icon__JUZRP" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 16 3 C 8.800781 3 3 8.800781 3 16 C 3 23.199219 8.800781 29 16 29 C 23.199219 29 29 23.199219 29 16 C 29 14.601563 28.8125 13.207031 28.3125 11.90625 L 26.6875 13.5 C 26.886719 14.300781 27 15.101563 27 16 C 27 22.101563 22.101563 27 16 27 C 9.898438 27 5 22.101563 5 16 C 5 9.898438 9.898438 5 16 5 C 19 5 21.695313 6.195313 23.59375 8.09375 L 25 6.6875 C 22.699219 4.386719 19.5 3 16 3 Z M 27.28125 7.28125 L 16 18.5625 L 11.71875 14.28125 L 10.28125 15.71875 L 15.28125 20.71875 L 16 21.40625 L 16.71875 20.71875 L 28.71875 8.71875 Z"></path></svg></div><span class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_gains-description-text__HgOZx">The AI Agent synthesizes fair test dataset based on use cases.</span></div><div class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-container___pKIC"><div><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 32 32" class="WhatTheAiAiEngineerDoes_point-icon__JUZRP" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M 16 3 C 8.800781 3 3 8.800781 3 16 C 3 23.199219 8.800781 29 16 29 C 23.199219 29 29 23.199219 29 16 C 29 14.601563 28.8125 13.207031 28.3125 11.90625 L 26.6875 13.5 C 26.886719 14.300781 27 15.101563 27 16 C 27 22.101563 22.101563 27 16 27 C 9.898438 27 5 22.101563 5 16 C 5 9.898438 9.898438 5 16 5 C 19 5 2