    Title_heading-type-black__XaDYF" style="font-size:32px;line-height:45px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Plus, all the possibilities your AI may demand...</h2></div><div class="ant-row css-bi7g14" style="margin-left:-12px;margin-right:-12px;row-gap:24px"><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 2C20.5523 2 21 2.44772 21 3V6.757L19 8.757V4H5V20H19V17.242L21 15.242V21C21 21.5523 20.5523 22 20 22H4C3.44772 22 3 21.5523 3 21V3C3 2.44772 3.44772 2 4 2H20ZM21.7782 8.80761L23.1924 10.2218L15.4142 18L13.9979 17.9979L14 16.5858L21.7782 8.80761ZM13 12V14H8V12H13ZM16 8V10H8V8H16Z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Write, Rewrite, Rewrite</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">AI drafts prompt text, identifies problems with real outputs, and iteratively improves.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6.076 1.637a.103.103 0 00-.09.05L.014 11.95a.102.102 0 000 .104l6.039 10.26c.04.068.14.068.18 0l5.972-10.262a.102.102 0 00-.002-.104L6.166 1.687a.103.103 0 00-.09-.05zm2.863 0c-.079 0-.13.085-.09.154l5.186 8.967a.105.105 0 00.09.053h3.117c.08 0 .13-.088.09-.157l-5.186-8.966a.104.104 0 00-.09-.051H8.94zm5.891 0a.102.102 0 00-.088.154L20.656 12l-5.914 10.209a.102.102 0 00.088.154h3.123a.1.1 0 00.088-.05l5.945-10.262a.1.1 0 000-.102L18.041 1.688a.1.1 0 00-.088-.051H14.83zm-.79 11.7a.1.1 0 00-.089.052l-5.101 8.82c-.04.069.01.154.09.154h3.117a.104.104 0 00.09-.05l5.1-8.82a.103.103 0 00-.09-.155h-3.118z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Multi-step Prompting</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Chain-of-Thought, ReAct, Query Optimization before Retrieval - all supported when you need.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M15 13V14H1.5L1 13.5V0H2V13H15Z"></path><rect x="5" y="2" width="2" height="2"></rect><rect x="12" y="1" width="2" height="2"></rect><rect x="8" y="5" width="2" height="2"></rect><rect x="5" y="9" width="2" height="2"></rect><rect x="12" y="8" width="2" height="2"></rect></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Serverless Vector Search</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Search and Retrieval is inevitable to modern AI, you can skip the infra setup and adopt without setup heavy work.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" stroke-width="2" d="M2,5.07692308 C2,5.07692308 3.66666667,2 12,2 C20.3333333,2 22,5.07692308 22,5.07692308 L22,18.9230769 C22,18.9230769 20.3333333,22 12,22 C3.66666667,22 2,18.9230769 2,18.9230769 L2,5.07692308 Z M2,13 C2,13 5.33333333,16 12,16 C18.6666667,16 22,13 22,13 M2,7 C2,7 5.33333333,10 12,10 C18.6666667,10 22,7 22,7"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Data Lake to Knowledge</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">AI Agents select docs, chunks and context relevant to your case, so you can just put your data like Data Lake. [Coming soon]</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z"></path><path d="M14.06 9.94 12 9l2.06-.94L15 6l.94 2.06L18 9l-2.06.94L15 12l-.94-2.06zM4 14l.94-2.06L7 11l-2.06-.94L4 8l-.94 2.06L1 11l2.06.94L4 14zm4.5-5 1.09-2.41L12 5.5 9.59 4.41 8.5 2 7.41 4.41 5 5.5l2.41 1.09L8.5 9zm-4 11.5 6-6.01 4 4L23 8.93l-1.41-1.41-7.09 7.97-4-4L3 19l1.5 1.5z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Quantifies qualitative outputs</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Natural language responses are subjective to judge. Our dynamic LLM-as-a-judge tries their best to score consistently at scale.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" stroke-width="2" d="M11,15 C14,15 19,19 19,19 L19,3 C19,3 14,7 11,7 C11,7 11,15 11,15 Z M5,15 L8,23 L12,23 L9,15 M19,14 C20.657,14 22,12.657 22,11 C22,9.343 20.657,8 19,8 M11,19 C11.9999997,18.9999994 14,18 14,16 M2,11 C2,7.88888889 3.7912,7 6,7 L11,7 L11,15 L6,15 C3.7912,15 2,14.1111111 2,11 Z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">AI speaks for itself</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Teammately AI Agents generate interactive reports to demystify the nearly black-box nature of AI for decision-makers.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 10c0-4.4 3.6-8 8-8s8 3.6 8 8-3.6 8-8 8H4"></path><polyline points="8 22 4 18 8 14"></polyline></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Deep Iteration</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Iteration does not stop after one epoch. Let AI infinitely refine your AI until they meet your goals.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" role="img" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M11.628 16.186l-2.047-2.14 6.791-5.953 1.21 1.302zm8.837 6.047c2.14-2.14 3.535-5.117 3.535-8.466 0-6.604-5.395-12-12-12s-12 5.396-12 12c0 3.35 1.302 6.326 3.535 8.466l1.674-1.675c-1.767-1.767-2.79-4.093-2.79-6.79A9.568 9.568 0 0 1 12 4.185a9.568 9.568 0 0 1 9.581 9.581c0 2.605-1.116 5.024-2.79 6.791Z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Finds the smallest model possible</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Big models may be intelligent but slow and expensive. You may achieve the same with smaller models by our AI’s careful tuning.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M20 8.04l-12.122 12.124a2.857 2.857 0 1 1 -4.041 -4.04l12.122 -12.124"></path><path d="M7 13h8"></path><path d="M19 15l1.5 1.6a2 2 0 1 1 -3 0l1.5 -1.6z"></path><path d="M15 3l6 6"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Feasibility study</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">You have a great idea but not sure whether it’s possible? Our Chat Agent can rationale you by studying rough feasibility before you invest in speculative tech.</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" stroke-width="2" d="M12,18 L12,8 L12,18 Z M12,23 C18.0751322,23 23,18.0751322 23,12 C23,5.92486775 18.0751322,1 12,1 C5.92486775,1 1,5.92486775 1,12 C1,18.0751322 5.92486775,23 12,23 Z M17,12 L12,7 L7,12"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Auto test new models</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">New models may improve your AI, but some may degrade. Our AI Agents test against your data rather than public benchmarks, so you can confidently upgrade. [Coming soon]</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill="none" stroke-width="2" d="M12,21 C7,21 1,16 1,12 C1,8 7,3 12,3 C17,3 23,8 23,12 C23,16 17,21 12,21 Z M12,7 C9.23875,7 7,9.23875 7,12 C7,14.76125 9.23875,17 12,17 C14.76125,17 17,14.76125 17,12 C17,9.23875 14.76125,7 12,7 L12,7 Z"></path></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Interpretability, not Observability</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Log observation is challenging in production LLM AI. Teammately AI Agents detect misbehavior and &quot;interpret&quot; their potential causes to minimize the time to resolve. [Coming soon]</span></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:12px;padding-right:12px" class="ant-col ant-col-6 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><div class="Capability_item-icon__v_ysz"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="color:var(--font-color-capability);width:18px;height:18px" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect width="8" height="8" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"></path><rect width="8" height="8" x="13" y="13" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:5px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-capability)">Neural Mesh</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:var(--teammately-secondary)">Dynamically connect and route gen/rag/model modules based on &quot;Neural Mesh&quot; architecture for even better results upon necessities. [Coming soon]</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="width:90%;margin:auto"><div class="Capability_deployment-container__LlQpr" style="border-top-left-radius:108px;border-bottom-right-radius:108px;padding:75px 0"><div class="page-container" style="position:relative"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-vertical" style="width:100%;gap:60px"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:30px"><div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #F97E49, #FEF5D6);display:inline-block;padding:2px;border-radius:12px;height:30px;box-shadow:0px 0px 20px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4)"><div style="border-radius:10px;background:var(--background-color-dark);overflow:hidden;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:1px 10px"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF">Deploy in minutes</span></div></div><h2 class="Title_heading__V67L_ 
    Title_heading-level-2__fkwub 
    Title_heading-type-white__t3FWj" style="font-size:32px;line-height:45px;font-weight:400">Deploy instantly, available globally in a single API</h2><div class="__className_37cf7d" style="text-align:center"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-white__Y__kN" style="font-size:20px;line-height:30px;font-weight:100">and the AI AI-Engineer monitors any misbehavior post-production</span></div></div><div id="lp-top-capability-copy-deploy-curl" class="Capability_deployment-curl-container__ShGNE" style="width:50%"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-justify-space-between"><code class="__className_c1e5c9" style="color:var(--font-color-code);padding:0 10px;transition:color 0.2s ease;font-size:16px">curl -X POST https://tmmt.ly/&lt;your-app-id&gt;</code><div style="border-radius:5px;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;width:30px;height:30px;background-color:transparent;transition:background-color 0.2s ease-in-out"><span role="img" aria-label="copy" style="color:var(--font-color-code);transition:color 0.2s ease;font-size:16px" class="anticon anticon-copy"><svg viewBox="64 64 896 896" focusable="false" data-icon="copy" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M832 64H296c-4.4 0-8 3.6-8 8v56c0 4.4 3.6 8 8 8h496v688c0 4.4 3.6 8 8 8h56c4.4 0 8-3.6 8-8V96c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zM704 192H192c-17.7 0-32 14.3-32 32v530.7c0 8.5 3.4 16.6 9.4 22.6l173.3 173.3c2.2 2.2 4.7 4 7.4 5.5v1.9h4.2c3.5 1.3 7.2 2 11 2H704c17.7 0 32-14.3 32-32V224c0-17.7-14.3-32-32-32zM350 856.2L263.9 770H350v86.2zM664 888H414V746c0-22.1-17.9-40-40-40H232V264h432v624z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div style="position:absolute;right:0;margin-right:10px;bottom:0;margin-bottom:-30px"><img alt="Rocket" loading="lazy" width="180" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Freading.903bee3a.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Freading.903bee3a.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Freading.903bee3a.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="ShowcasePickup_container__34PNE"><d