    undefined"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-gap-small"><span style="font-size:20px">See all AI App</span></div></button></a></div></div></div><div id="testimonials" class="FounderSays_founder-says-container__tP3GD" style="padding:120px 0"><div class="page-container"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:60px"><h2 class="Title_heading__V67L_ 
    Title_heading-level-2__fkwub 
    Title_heading-type-black__XaDYF" style="font-size:32px;line-height:48px;font-weight:300;color:var(--font-color-founder-says);font-style:italic">&quot;The (Human) AI-Engineers can transform into more creative roles.&quot;</h2><div class="ant-row css-bi7g14" style="margin-left:-75px;margin-right:-75px;row-gap:45px"><div style="padding-left:75px;padding-right:75px" class="ant-col ant-col-10 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:12px"><a target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://youtu.be/n5L-qzWQZEQ?si=iOf0Zb2QZ4WsLaP-"><img alt="Founder Tom Ohtsuka session at The AI Conference 2024" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="720" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px;width:475px;height:275px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fthumbnail_ai-conference-2024.1bbd2346.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fthumbnail_ai-conference-2024.1bbd2346.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Fthumbnail_ai-conference-2024.1bbd2346.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></a><div><a id="lp-top-foundersays-btn-video-aiconference2024" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" href="https://youtu.be/n5L-qzWQZEQ?si=iOf0Zb2QZ4WsLaP-"><span class="FounderSays_polite-text-link__0sWnu" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400">Watch video<!-- --> <span>→</span></span></a></div></div></div><div style="padding-left:75px;padding-right:75px" class="ant-col ant-col-14 css-bi7g14"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:12px"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-center ant-flex-justify-flex-start ant-flex-gap-large"><img alt="Tom Ohtsuka, the Founder of Teammately" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent;border-radius:50px" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftom.e6ddc040.jpeg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftom.e6ddc040.jpeg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Ftom.e6ddc040.jpeg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-flex-start ant-flex-justify-space-between ant-flex-vertical" style="gap:10px"><span style="font-size:24px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-founder-says)">Tom Ohtsuka</span><span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:300;color:var(--font-color-founder-says)">Founder, CEO &amp; CTO of Teammately</span><a id="lp-top-foundersays-btn-linkedin-tom" target="_blank" class="FounderSays_icon-container__k6urL" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tom-ohtsuka/"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 448 512" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M416 32H31.9C14.3 32 0 46.5 0 64.3v383.4C0 465.5 14.3 480 31.9 480H416c17.6 0 32-14.5 32-32.3V64.3c0-17.8-14.4-32.3-32-32.3zM135.4 416H69V202.2h66.5V416zm-33.2-243c-21.3 0-38.5-17.3-38.5-38.5S80.9 96 102.2 96c21.2 0 38.5 17.3 38.5 38.5 0 21.3-17.2 38.5-38.5 38.5zm282.1 243h-66.4V312c0-24.8-.5-56.7-34.5-56.7-34.6 0-39.9 27-39.9 54.9V416h-66.4V202.2h63.7v29.2h.9c8.9-16.8 30.6-34.5 62.9-34.5 67.2 0 79.7 44.3 79.7 101.9V416z"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class="__className_37cf7d" style="text-align:left"><div class="ant-flex css-bi7g14 ant-flex-align-stretch ant-flex-gap-small ant-flex-vertical"><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:18px;line-height:27px;font-weight:400;color:var(--font-color-founder-says);font-style:italic">&quot;With the AI Agent, the (Human) AI-Engineers will be able to ensure the AI quality and performance far exceed what a human-only team could have ever achieved. They can transform into more creative roles, focusing on identifying and defining the true value of AI, and they become evangelists to their community by sharing far more advanced and valuable AI products.&quot;</span><span class="Text_text__MBjIB
    Text_text-type-black__8BzES" style="font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:300;color:var(--font-color-founder-says)">- The session at The AI Conference 2024 in San Francisco: &quot;Let AI build AI&quot;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="Chat_chat-container__2_ABa"><div class="page-container"><div class="Flex_container__uXCZz Flex_vertical__c2_V9 Flex_align-center__1YUgO" style="gap:25px"><div class="Flex_container__uXCZz Flex_vertical__c2_V9 Flex_align-center__1YUgO" style="gap:15px;width:100%"><img alt="Teammately Icon" fetchPriority="high" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/icon-silhouette.146aab51.svg"/><h2 class="Title_heading__V67L_ 
